        "orario": "15:00",
        "timestamp": 1780491600,
        "contenuto_esteso": "America’s 250th birthday could have been — should have been — a celebration to end all celebrations. The nation’s biggest birthday yet could have been an opportunity for both commemoration and recommitment, a festival marking a quarter millennium of democracy and a challenge to envision a bolder, better, brighter America for the generations to come. Instead, we..."
