        "titolo_orig": "Paralympic gold medalist Josh Turek wins Iowa Senate primary with establishment support",
        "testo_it": "Il paralimpico Josh Turek vince le primarie democratiche per il Senato in Iowa.",
        "priorita": "Bassa",
